    "note": "Lemma 1-2: the category-level reduction reproduces the pooled gradient Wald statistic exactly; Lemma 3: permuting the labels in the fast representation equals relabelling d in the data and refitting (loadings re-estimated) to machine precision; Definition 4: the wild-cluster-bootstrap statistic at the identity draw v == 1 reproduces the observed Wald exactly; equation (6): the cluster contributions zeta_g sum to gamma_hat on the post block."
  },
